 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** The selection logic is $O(1)$, involving a single comparison and potential dimension swap. The impact on overall render time depends on the chosen tile size's efficiency in reducing duplicated Gaussian processing versus increasing sequential load per tile [S1].
-- **Memory Complexity:** $O(1)$ for the selection logic. The tile size choice affects the granularity of shared memory usage and cache efficiency, but no additional data structures are required for the selection itself [S1].
